	"descriptionMarkdown": "Addon for DocJade's The Automall and possibly others too if the crafting machine doesn't lock on to a recipe permanently.\nIt needs to give up after a while if the fluid supplied  isn't the one required.\n\nAllows you to craft fluid dependant recipe.\n\nFeatures:\n1) No supply pipe leak when switching recipe. (hopefully)\n2) 6 Tanks to reuse previous recipe's fluid.\n3) Prioritize fluid in the tank over supply pipe.\n4) No fluid leftover in pumps.\n5) Automatic emergency pump to purge last tank if all 7 tanks are full and recipe require a fluid not currently available in the tanks.\n\nSet-up: \n1) If using DocJade's Automall remove all the fluid condition in the decider combinator with the 2 \"Anything\" signal to enable crafting recipe that need fluid. Do not remove the Anything condition.\n2) Use 2 separate green wire to connect each decider combinator with \"Water\" signal to Assembler/other crafting machine.\n3) Check the read crafting machine's ingredients box.\n4) Connect supply fluid to the top pump, there's 17 pump 1 for each fluid type excluding space-only one, lava, fluoroketone (hot) and plasma.\n\nLimitations:\n1) Limited by speed of pump.\n2) Switching between different recipe can cause all 6 tanks to be filled quickly if switching between recipe quickly that require different fluid.\n3) Limited to 7 different fluids at a time: 6 in Tanks and 1 from supply. Limit yourself to 6 to be 100% it works.\n4) Limit supply to 7 (6 to be safe) fluids type and add more copy of the fluid switcher with leftover fluid type or manually empty a tank to free space.\n5) If 2 tank have the same fluid but are separated you can merge them by using a recipe that require said fluid.\n6) Doesn't work for recipe with 2 fluid ingredients.\n7) Pump to purge last tank is set-up but doesn't go anywhere, it only get activated if you try to craft a recipe with a fluid that's not in any tank and all of them are full. It will de-activate when the last tank is empty. You have to plug it into something if you plan to have more than 6 or 7 types of fluid in the switcher. I would suggest either into a external tank plugged into your fluid supply with a pump or possibly multiple tank/pump combo to allow multiple different fluid. Really you have to figure out this part by yourself sorry.\n\nLink to a 18 tanks version: https://factorioprints.com/view/-OmHAZ_jeAAdYMXM4Tt-\nMulti-fluid version: https://factorioprints.com/view/-OmI89wy-71qUvZtsNti\nDocJade's Automall: https://blueprints.docjade.com/",
